				Time="2011-10-13T12:33:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>チェレン『二人とも　みて！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-13T13:02:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-13T12:33:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・GRIDX＝164、GRIDZ＝665
・主人公たちを向いてメッセージ表示
・続けてswleader1_02</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
