				Time="2011-10-13T12:43:26" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-13T12:32:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
